            <div xml:id="d585">

                <pb facs="0732" n="633" sameAs="frus:frus1936v02/pg633"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">852.00/2205: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Consul at Bilbao</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Chapman</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bilbao</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1936-07-23T10:00:00+00:00">July 23, 1936—10
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received July 23—9:10 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Bilbao virtually in state siege, food shortage very likely to bring about looting
                    since authorities are not in a position to prevent it. American citizens having
                    no assurance protection, request that war vessel take women and children as soon
                    as possible.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Chapman</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
